 "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "pingpong"}, "name": "pingpong", "label": "pingpong", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "pingpong"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_output"}, "name": "save_output", "label": "save_output", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "save_output"}, {"widget": {"name": "no_preview"}, "shape": 7, "name": "no_preview", "label": "no_preview", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "no_preview"}], "flags": {}, "id": 485, "type": "VHS_VideoCombine", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_VideoCombine"}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [794], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the anthropomorphic golden-haired dog from the first image. It wears a bright yellow motorcycle helmet and grips the scooter handlebars like a seasoned street racer. It maintains a stoic, cool \"ghost fire youth\" vibe until its composure is shattered.\n<Subject 2> is the silver-haired fox-eared girl from the second image. She wears a light mint-green strap dress, with fluffy silver fox ears and silver leaf earrings. She is sitting sideways on the back seat, her arms wrapped around the dog's neck, utterly thrilled.\n<Subject 3> is the piece of watermelon, a bright, juicy red triangular slice with black seeds. It will become the ultimate \"weapon of mass distraction\" in the final seconds.\n<Picture 1> is the still frame of <Subject 1> riding the scooter at night, used as the first-frame anchor.\n<Picture 2> is the still frame of <Subject 2> holding the watermelon in a sunny outdoor setting, used as the reaction-shot anchor.\n<Audio 1> is the user-provided 28-second custom audio track, featuring a high-energy electronic/rock remix, the girl's exhilarated screaming, the screech of tires, and a comical crash sound effect.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reuse] The target video is a 28-second high-octane, cinematic comedy short. Set on a completely empty urban street at night, <Subject 1> transforms into a wild \"ghost fire youth\" rider, performing reckless, spectacular drifts and burnouts while <Subject 2> shouts with thrill on the back. The fast-paced cyberpunk romance is suddenly and hilariously interrupted when the girl offers a piece of watermelon, causing the distracted dog to crash spectacularly at top speed. The target video fully copies <Audio 1> as its synchronized adrenaline-comedy soundscape.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1] through [Shot 8]): fully_preserved - the yellow helmet, fluffy golden coat, and deadpan coolness are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 5], [Shot 7], [Shot 8]): fully_preserved - the silver fox ears, mint-green dress, and excited expression are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 6], [Shot 7]): fully_preserved - the red juicy watermelon triangle is retained.\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the dark city street with streetlights is retained.\n<Picture 2> ([Shot 2] first frame): fully_preserved - the girl's bright smile from the original image is adapted to the night setting.\n<Audio 1>: fully_copy - the 28-second custom soundtrack controls the pacing from smooth cruise to chaotic drift to final crash.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a cinematic \"cyberpunk street racing\" aesthetic, shot with wide-angle lenses, heavy motion blur, and dynamic tracking cameras. The first half is filled with adrenaline, and the second half shifts to over-the-top slapstick comedy.\n[Shot 1] The video opens with a wide, high-angle establishing shot of an empty, neon-lit urban boulevard at midnight. <Subject 1> rides its electric scooter steadily into the frame. The camera smoothly tracks it from above. A dark, driving electronic bass beat kicks in.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the camera drops to a low-angle, dramatic tracking shot from the front tire. <Subject 1> aggressively twists the throttle. The rear tire screeches, and the scooter lunges forward. Sitting behind it, <Subject 2> (S2) tightens her arms around the dog and lets out a wild, excited scream, <d>[Chinese] 哇哇偶！</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the first major drift. The camera cuts to a fast-paced, sweeping side-tracking shot. <Subject 1> abruptly jerks the handlebars and stamps the ground with its paws, sending the scooter into a massive, sweeping 180-degree drift across the empty intersection. The blue LED headlight carves a crescent of light on the asphalt. Smoke billows from the rear tire.\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.000, an action montage of pure street racing. Quick cuts show <Subject 1> weaving in and out of a slalom path along the road, leaning sharp into corners, its paws actively sliding on the ground to maintain balance. The visual rhythm is fast, chaotic, and thrilling. <Subject 2> (S2) screams with pure adrenaline in her voice, <d>[Chinese] 快一点！再快一点！好刺激！！</d>\n[Shot 5] At 00:14.500, a dramatic slow-motion shot. The camera captures a stunning, wide-angle slide of the scooter sliding sideways through the rain-wet asphalt. <Subject 2> holds onto <Subject 1>, her silver hair flying wildly in the wind, her eyes wide with thrill. The dog maintains a completely deadpan, unbothered \"cool\" expression. The music peaks with a screeching guitar solo.\n[Shot 6] At 00:18.500, the climax of the speed. The scooter speeds down a straight stretch of road. Without warning, <Subject 2> pulls the large slice of <Subject 3> (the watermelon) out of nowhere and holds it directly in front of <Subject 1>'s face, blocking its view of the road.\n[Shot 7] At 00:21.000, the ultimate distraction. <Subject 1> (S1) glances at the juicy red watermelon. Its eyes instantly widen, the coolness evaporates. A violent pink blush erupts across its face. It slowly, dreamily reaches out a paw for the fruit. <Subject 2> (S2) laughs playfully and teases, <d>[Chinese] 嘿嘿，想吃吗？</d>\n[Shot 8] At 00:24.000, the inevitable disaster. While <Subject 1> is completely entranced by the watermelon, it completely loses control of the steering. The scooter veers off the straight path and slams head-on into a concrete utility pole on the sidewalk. A massive *BOOM* and a screeching crash sound erupt. The camera does a dramatic whip-pan, following the dog's helmet flying off in a comical arc.\n[Shot 9] At 00:26.000, the final freeze-frame. Both <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> are thrown off the scooter and land safely on a patch of grass beside the road. The dog is sprawled flat on its back, its tongue lolling out, utterly dazed. <Subject 2> sits on the ground, holding the watermelon completely intact, letting out a breathless, helpless giggle. The final line comes from <Subject 2> (S2), with a mix of amusement and concern, <d>[Chinese] 哎呀，让你别分心嘛！</d> The screen fades to black on the chaotic yet sweet aftermath.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe physical soundscape is intensely layered: the growling, whining hum of the electric scooter motor under heavy load; the piercing, rubber-screeching sound of tires sliding on pavement; the howling of the wind whipping past; the sharp, echoing metallic *BOOM* of impact with the utility pole; and the final soft giggle.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA high-energy, driving electronic synth-wave remix of a classic ballad. It features a pounding, fast-paced bass drum, aggressive synthesizer leads, and a sudden, dramatic record-scratch sound right before the crash. The track abruptly ends at the moment of impact, leaving only ambient street noise, the girl's laugh, and the final fading note of an acoustic guitar."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 788, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": 